+/* Metroid/Nothing Phone (3) CDC-ECM USB Ethernet.
+ * Reuses the repository's Redmi DWC3/ECM implementation (0072-0076,0081),
+ * adapted to Tuna clocks, inherited eUSB2 PHY and stream0x40 SMMUv2 DMA.
+ * No PHY/power reset, global SMMU reset, or phone storage writes.
+ * Hardware enumeration and app internet remain to be validated.
+ */
